WEBVTT

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:00.108
i umetničkim okrugom s druge strane,

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:02.820
kao i da pokušamo
da ih spojimo u jedinstvenu celinu.

00:13:03.237 --> 00:13:06.490
Gotov projekat nosi naziv
„Hiljadu stabala”.

00:13:07.241 --> 00:13:12.830
(Aplauz)

00:13:13.664 --> 00:13:17.084
Svaki od ovih stubova
ima kinesko planinsko drvo,

00:13:17.084 --> 00:13:19.044
poluodraslo planinsko drvo na vrhu.

00:13:19.044 --> 00:13:25.008
Kao i ishranu, drenažu, svetlo i vlagu

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:28.929
zato što je svaki stub
najbolje mesto da se stavi veliki teret.

00:13:29.763 --> 00:13:33.308
A ima i na stotine spoljnih terasa,